g\":8.4,\"year\":2010,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Cobb, a skilled thief who commits corporate espionage by infiltrating the subconscious of his targets is offered a chance to regain his old life as payment for a task considered to be impossible: \\\"inception\\\", the implantation of another person's idea into a target's subconscious.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":891621,\"title\":\"Wild Horse Nine\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dNJFRtVg3xLQ7dbNIQ55cmmIniD.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3uLA0ujne91bkzFStZICCYeqhnt.jpg\",\"rating\":7.9,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Shortly before the 1973 Chilean coup, CIA agents Chris and Lee are dispatched from Santiago to Easter Island by their bureau chief, MJ. Amongst the Island's iconic statues, and as the longtime partners wrestle with their dark pasts and present conspiracies, Chris's newfound bond with a pair of rebellious students threatens to send everyone’s trip to this remote paradise sideways.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Crime\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":432836,\"title\":\"Memoir of a Murderer\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eTdvO9AwJrxq02iYf4Lu5qA0fNc.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/axRYPjeLD4zjJNaIw4TPopbKVfs.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A former serial killer with Alzheimer's fights to protect his daughter from her mysterious boyfriend who may be a serial killer too.\",\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Mystery\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":155,\"title\":\"The Dark Knight\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qJ2tW6WMUDux911r6m7haRef0WH.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cfT29Im5VDvjE0RpyKOSdCKZal7.jpg\",\"rating\":8.5,\"year\":2008,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Batman raises the stakes in his war on crime. With the help of Lt. Jim Gordon and District Attorney Harvey Dent, Batman sets out to dismantle the remaining criminal organizations that plague the streets. The partnership proves to be effective, but they soon find themselves prey to a reign of chaos unleashed by a rising criminal mastermind known to the terrified citizens of Gotham as the Joker.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Thriller\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1419406,\"title\":\"The Shadow's Edge\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cHKo3m8N1fwvEy2ZEr0xGmmMODV.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4BtL2vvEufDXDP4u6xQjjQ1Y2aT.jpg\",\"rating\":8.4,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Macau Police brings the tracking expert police officer out of retirement to help catch a dangerous group of professional thieves.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Crime\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1375441,\"title\":\"Primetime\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lmrulvLbmaejTix1YaMxo1oGhH1.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sEsMwSDUWGIx9EfNxzM6KzVSsSQ.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In 2006, To Catch a Predator host Chris Hansen sets out to make television history. When a high stakes operation goes fatally wrong, his veneered dream of fame curdles into a nightmare of performative justice.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Drama\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1571955,\"title\":\"Collision Course\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/s2eAK0uiODjlNUSIiOBwdp3at2u.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uI3kWI7kGW5E0F8WduewgQYPt34.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Spain, 2013. After robbing a bank, a getaway crash reveals the hidden side of each thief, exposing betrayals and lies that began long before the heist.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Drama\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":414906,\"title\":\"The Batman\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/74xTEgt7R36Fpooo50r9T25onhq.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https:/